@startuml reservation_state
' the reservation rule of uuid7_gen(), one call (SDD <5.2>); hand-written, checked against app/uuid7.c
title Reservation rule of one uuid7_gen() call
skinparam shadowing false
[*] --> Entropy
Entropy : fill the 8 tail bytes from the RNG
Entropy --> RngFailed : the RNG returns non-zero
RngFailed : return -2, nothing written, state unchanged
RngFailed --> [*]
Entropy --> Candidate : ok
state Candidate {
  [*] --> Compare
  Compare : now = the clock (0 if clock_gettime() fails)
  Compare --> NewMillisecond : now > last ms
  NewMillisecond : candidate = (now, 0)
  Compare --> SameMillisecond : now <= last ms, seq < 4095
  SameMillisecond : candidate = (last ms, seq + 1)
  Compare --> Borrow : now <= last ms, seq = 4095
  Borrow : candidate = (last ms + 1, 0)
}
Candidate --> Refused : candidate ms >= 2^48, or > now + UUID7_MAX_AHEAD_MS (clock ok)
Refused : return -3, nothing written, state unchanged
Refused --> [*]
Candidate --> Swap : within the bounds
Swap : compare-and-swap the state word
Swap --> Candidate : another thread reserved first
Swap --> Encode : swapped: the pair is this call's
Encode : write the 16 bytes
Encode --> [*] : return 0
@enduml
